umber":26,"title":"Solomon's Wish","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":27,"title":"Royal Conflict","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":28,"title":"Eyes on the Orb","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":29,"title":"Angelic Grace, Demonic Counsel","synopsis":"Balt places a curse over all of Lecillia, then disappears along with the Orb. Solomon and Levy both work in their own ways to lift the curse, but...","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":30,"title":"Dark Machinations","synopsis":"Those saps are goners. With Forneus and Cassiel, Solomon seeks out Balt to save her people. Along the way however, Forneus senses that Lecillia is in danger...","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":31,"title":"Unwavering Resolve","synopsis":"Solomon and Levy have successfully held off the Great Sands' invasion on Lecillia. But an even greater threat draws near...","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":32,"title":"Conviction and Tears","synopsis":"Solomon has been taken captive by the Scyzari Empire. The guilt of endangering Lecillia weighs heavily on Levy's heart. What does fate have in store for these two daughters of Lecillia...","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":33,"title":"Passing of the Torch","synopsis":"- Promise me that you will protect the smiles of the people. - Many moons ago, Malkuth, newly-risen emperor of Scyzari, called for an audience with the First King of Lecillia. Not even the king, however, could have imaged Malkuth's dreadful intentions, or the harrowing events that young Solomon would witness...","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":34,"title":"Rising Above","synopsis":"- If it would save my people... my life's a small price to pay! - Solomon resolves to save her people, even if it means giving up her life. Meanwhile, Balt attempts to access the forbidden book of demons...","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":35,"title":"Awakening","synopsis":"- The light of Lecillia will not be snuffed out... - Levy stands face-to-face with her father's murderer, Malkuth. Does her ice magic stand a chance against this mighty foe?","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":36,"title":"Transcendence","synopsis":"- I won't let you get away with this! - Solomon's newly-awakened power summons forth Forneus' true form. In a grand display of his power, the Great Marquis of the Netherworld tries to stop Malkuth, however...","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":37,"title":"One in Heart and Mind","synopsis":"Solomon and Levy finally unite to protect their beloved people. The final battle against the now almighty Malkuth is at hand...","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":38,"title":"Transcendence","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":39,"title":"The Scaly-Skin Pirates","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":40,"title":"Thus Spoke Pellinore","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":41,"title":"The Chosen","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":42,"title":"The Beguiled","synopsis":"Arthur faces her fellow pupil Arawin in battle, but something inside him has changed after all these years. What can Arthur do to stand against his blood-lust and magic blade...?!","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":43,"title":"The Knights Strike Back","synopsis":"The fearsome Decemvir Tiphereth would even block out the sun with a disco ball in the name of beauty. Arthur's group returns to Britannia, but can they save her neon-coated friends and people...?","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":44,"title":"A Radiant World","synopsis":"Arthur confronts Tiphereth's true form. With her country and life on the line, she stands firm in a heated battle against the Decemvir's enhanced strength. Who will come out on top of their intense battle...?","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":45,"title":"A Dying World","synopsis":"On a world where nearly all life has been wiped out, a young man named Noah gathers Orb Fragments to power his ark, dreaming of one day escaping the planet with its surviving animals. One day, some strange life forms fall from the sky! Who—or what—could they be...?!","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":46,"title":"Episodio 46","synopsis":"After setting off in search of a giant Orb, Noah and the others are attacked by a strange creature called an Adaptor. The group manages to defeat the beast and later spends the night in a deserted town. There Noah reveals the origins of his mechanical body,just before they face a terrible new foe...!","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":47,"title":"Pact's Conclusion","synopsis":"Noah's group discovers an enormous Orb, but it's deep inside an Adaptor nest! Chesed makes a pinky swear with Noah before going off on his own to collect the Orb's energy. However...","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":48,"title":"Ark of Treachery","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":49,"title":"Worth Dying For","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":50,"title":"A New Journey","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":51,"title":"Revenant","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":52,"title":"Shadow of Doubt","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":53,"title":"The Ties That Bind","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":54,"title":"Deceptive Sisters","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":55,"title":"Then There Were Two","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":56,"title":"Covenant's Kiss","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":57,"title":"And the Bell Tolls","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":58,"title":"Heroes United","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":59,"title":"Gate of Ruin","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":60,"title":"In Love's Name","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episode